<title>DENMARK: Danish Hypotekbanken raises four pct bond offer.</title>
<headline>Danish Hypotekbanken raises four pct bond offer.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken on Friday raised an existing 1.200 billion crown, four percent bond offer to 1.400 billion crowns, a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The bond matures in 2002 and the issue is being arranged by Gudme Raaschou Bankaktieselskab, it said. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
